                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5d6b5374-7107-387f-a22c-43b22b9523f5",
                        "entry_id": "57c70376-f5cf-3c13-988c-ba2ca50c7bb4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "разг. женск. к лингвист"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0d6e86fd-3009-4cd9-a235-d96a3afed3bb",
                                "sense_id": "5d6b5374-7107-387f-a22c-43b22b9523f5",
                                "text": "Лингвистка, сухонькая женщина в звании манипулярия, вышла из комнаты."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c36d30bc-02eb-4e7b-b386-bab6e0b7adcc",
                                "sense_id": "5d6b5374-7107-387f-a22c-43b22b9523f5",
                                "text": "Таким образом, Александр Александрович брал одну какую-то \"неглобальную\" черту (на первый взгляд!), например Прекрасная гречанка (об аспирантке с примесью греческой крови), Сеттер — ученый с шелковистой рыжеватой бородой, Минареточка — высокая стройная и красивая лингвистка."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1c5d7173-c3a0-45b9-a0a1-fbfba3ef4ee4",
                        "source_entry_id": "57c70376-f5cf-3c13-988c-ba2ca50c7bb4",
                        "source_sense_id": "5d6b5374-7107-387f-a22c-43b22b9523f5",
                        "target_lang_word": "linguist",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "linguist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a7e8b132-d66f-36c6-87b4-dd8791cb8abb",
                                        "entry_id": "d9fada07-48c0-32a8-af0c-fa98061672df",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who studies linguistics."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b62db118-d369-3d56-9a6a-d3a6ae5facea",
                                        "entry_id": "d9fada07-48c0-32a8-af0c-fa98061672df",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who studies linguistics.",
                                            "One who studies modern-day linguistics, that is, linguistic science."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c88ea51d-17d7-41c5-a40e-a4fe1604e1db",
                                                "sense_id": "b62db118-d369-3d56-9a6a-d3a6ae5facea",
                                                "text": "President Donald Trump has \"turned words into weapons\" -- and journalists are providing additional ammunition.\nThat's according to Trump critic George Lakoff, a renowned linguist and professor emeritus at the University of California at Berkeley."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "be9080ce-95d0-45cf-847b-e06d3bbfcae4",
                                                "sense_id": "b62db118-d369-3d56-9a6a-d3a6ae5facea",
                                                "text": "The internet serves as an accelerant to fanilects. Because song lyrics are readily available online, they have a characteristic linguists call \"persistence,\" meaning anyone can refer to them and reuse them."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4e8590fd-b9ec-34b7-8937-b1ade7b33d99",
                                        "entry_id": "d9fada07-48c0-32a8-af0c-fa98061672df",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person skilled in languages."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ed7e05f8-dbf6-4c98-919f-d2eec26c8432",
                                                "sense_id": "4e8590fd-b9ec-34b7-8937-b1ade7b33d99",
                                                "text": "The words of these songs were either without meaning, or derived from an idiom with which Watt, a very fair linguist, had no acquaintance."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5fa8c2ce-fd61-387a-848e-db093c77f272",
                                        "entry_id": "d9fada07-48c0-32a8-af0c-fa98061672df",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A human translator; an interpreter, especially in the armed forces."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0baf6ce9-59ec-4244-b10a-add0a1e94104",
                        "source_entry_id": "57c70376-f5cf-3c13-988c-ba2ca50c7bb4",
                        "source_sense_id": "5d6b5374-7107-387f-a22c-43b22b9523f5",
                        "target_lang_word": "Linguistin",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Linguistin",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "99b3aec2-08fa-3f77-b583-10b48e171fa6",
                                        "entry_id": "a3b7b5ad-e8ac-3463-aa4f-b1303ba42a17",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "weibliche Person, die sich wissenschaftlich mit Sprache befasst"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2e5c153d-0509-475d-b0f5-db34b7026926",
                                                "sense_id": "99b3aec2-08fa-3f77-b583-10b48e171fa6",
                                                "text": "„Linguistinnen und Linguisten verfügen idealerweise über vielfältige sprachliche Register und Stile, die es ihnen ermöglichen, fachliche Inhalte adressatengerecht zu kommunizieren, und sie wissen, welche Form welchem Adressatenkreis gegenüber angemessen ist.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bd11ff8a-4618-4fb1-90f4-46dd0adf5154",
                                                "sense_id": "99b3aec2-08fa-3f77-b583-10b48e171fa6",
                                                "text": "„Die Linguistin befragte die Auswanderer auch danach, wie heimatverbunden sie sich fühlen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a5b15a9d-84ef-45b4-998c-3b34315d5199",
                                                "sense_id": "99b3aec2-08fa-3f77-b583-10b48e171fa6",
                                                "text": "„Je mehr wir subvokalisieren, glaubt die Linguistin Elizabeth Schotter, desto besser funktioniert unser Gedächtnis und desto besser verarbeiten wir das, was wir lesen.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f013d28d-816e-40d5-b783-0a5ee03e730d",
                        "source_entry_id": "57c70376-f5cf-3c13-988c-ba2ca50c7bb4",
                        "source_sense_id": "5d6b5374-7107-387f-a22c-43b22b9523f5",
                        "target_lang_word": "lingwistka",
                        "target_lang_code": "pl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "lingwistka",
                                "target_lang_code": "pl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7e855fc0-d867-3273-99f8-d63e1b47e4ed",
                                        "entry_id": "5274108f-bde9-3d37-a4a0-6b1d97564887",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "specjalistka w zakresie lingwistyki"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
